cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Arc Reactor Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dimensional deuterium tritium power balance for ARC-class compact
  high-field tokamaks, evaluating the operational limits a design point has to
  respect and converting the result into net electrical output. Every quantity is
  benchmarked against three published design points, ARC, ITER and SPARC, and the
  disagreements are reported rather than tuned away.
type: software
authors:
